## Summary

| Question | Answer | How |
|---|---|---|
| Dynamic form from Programs? | ✅ **Yes** | `getBookingHierarchy()` reads `tenantSettings` → populates all 3 cascading dropdowns |
| Reserve a Court → Members page? | ✅ **Yes** | Auto-enrolls member doc on booking → Members page reads via `getPlanDetails()` |
| Multi-tenant isolation? | ✅ **Yes, 3 layers** | User binding + query scoping + Firestore security rules |
